// lowering calls: velt_common's `std_hooks.rs` names each one. No program imports them: the
// prelude loads this list (std/prelude/hooks.vlt), and proxy.vlt, which only programs with a
// `Proxy` need, comes with it (std/prelude/global/proxy.vlt).

